payload.text:
¡Excelente! Ya estás dentro del editor (StackBlitz). Esa pantalla negra con código es tu "taller".

Ahora vamos a convertir ese proyecto vacío en **Ferry**. Tienes que hacer lo que llamamos "Cirugía de Código": borrar lo que hay y pegar lo nuevo.

Sigue estos pasos con calma. No tengas miedo de borrar cosas, si te equivocas, solo dale `Ctrl + Z`.

### PASO 1: Limpiar y Actualizar los Archivos que YA existen

En la barra lateral izquierda (donde están los nombres de archivos), haz clic en cada uno, **borra todo su contenido** y pega el código nuevo que te dejo aquí abajo.

#### 1. Haz clic en `index.html`
Borra todo y pega esto:
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=0" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f97316" />
    <title>Ferry - Construcción</title>
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json" />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
      tailwind.config = {
        theme: {
          extend: {
            colors: {
              ferry: { 50:'#fff7ed', 100:'#ffedd5', 500:'#f97316', 600:'#ea580c', 700:'#c2410c' },
              slate: { 850:'#1e293b', 900:'#0f172a' }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    </script>
    <style> body { overscroll-behavior-y: none; } .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; } </style>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-gray-50 text-slate-900 antialiased">
    <div id="root"></div>
  </body>
</html>
```

#### 2. Haz clic en `index.tsx` (o `main.tsx`)
Borra todo y pega esto:
```tsx
import React from 'react';
import ReactDOM from 'react-dom/client';
import App from './App';

if ('serviceWorker' in navigator) {
  navigator.serviceWorker.register('/sw.js').catch(() => {});
}

ReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(
  <React.StrictMode>
    <App />
  </React.StrictMode>
);
```

---

### PASO 2: Crear los Archivos Nuevos

Ahora necesitamos crear los archivos que faltan.
En la barra izquierda, busca un icono que parece una **hoja de papel con un "+"** (dice "New File").

#### 1. Crea un archivo llamado `types.ts`
Pega esto adentro:
```typescript
export enum UserRole { USER = 'USER', ADMIN = 'ADMIN', STORE = 'STORE' }
export enum RequestStatus { DRAFT='DRAFT', PENDING_QUOTES='PENDING_QUOTES', QUOTED='QUOTED', PAID='PAID', DELIVERED='DELIVERED' }
export interface MaterialItem { name: string; quantity: string; unit: string; }
export interface QuoteLineItem { name: string; quantity: string; unit: string; status: 'AVAILABLE' | 'MISSING'; price?: number; }
export interface Quote { id: string; storeName: string; totalPrice: number; deliveryTime: string; availability: string; rating: number; includesTransport: boolean; itemsDetails: QuoteLineItem[]; }
export interface MaterialRequest { id: string; title: string; date: string; category?: string; items: MaterialItem[]; status: RequestStatus; quotes: Quote[]; selectedQuoteId?: string; }
export interface Product { id: string; storeId: string; name: string; price: number; stock: number; category: string; description: string; image: string; }
export interface Project { id: string; title: string; location: string; description: string; budget: string; isUrgent: boolean; category: string; postedBy: string; status: 'OPEN' | 'IN_PROGRESS' | 'COMPLETED'; }
export interface ContractorProfile { id: string; name: string; role: string; isVerified: boolean; rating: number; completedJobs: number; yearsExperience: number; bio: string; skills: string[]; portfolioImages: string[]; reviews: any[]; references?: any[]; }
```

#### 2. Crea un archivo llamado `UIComponents.tsx`
Pega esto adentro:
```tsx
import React from 'react';
import { Loader2 } from 'lucide-react';

export const Button: React.FC<any> = ({ children, variant = 'primary', className = '', isLoading, ...props }) => {
  const base = "px-4 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 active:scale-95";
  const styles: any = { primary: "bg-ferry-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-ferry-500/30", secondary: "bg-slate-800 text-white", outline: "border-2 border-slate-200 text-slate-700", ghost: "bg-transparent text-slate-600" };
  return <button className={`${base} ${styles[variant]} ${className}`} disabled={isLoading} {...props}>{isLoading && <Loader2 className="animate-spin w-4 h-4"/>}{children}</button>;
};
export const Card: React.FC<any> = ({ children, className = '', onClick }) => (
  <div onClick={onClick} className={`bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 p-4 ${className}`}>{children}</div>
);
export const Badge: React.FC<any> = ({ children, type = 'neutral' }) => {
  const styles: any = { success: 'bg-green-100 text-green-700', warning: 'bg-orange-100 text-orange-700', info: 'bg-blue-100 text-blue-700', neutral: 'bg-slate-100 text-slate-600' };
  return <span className={`px-2 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium ${styles[type]}`}>{children}</span>;
};
export const StarRating: React.FC<{ rating: number }> = ({ rating }) => (
  <div className="flex text-yellow-400 text-sm">{[...Array(5)].map((_, i) => <span key={i}>{i < rating ? "★" : "☆"}</span>)}</div>
);
```

#### 3. Crea un archivo llamado `manifest.json`
Pega esto:
```json
{
  "name": "Ferry",
  "short_name": "Ferry",
  "start_url": "/",
  "display": "standalone",
  "background_color": "#ffffff",
  "theme_color": "#f97316",
  "icons": [
    { "src": "https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2897/2897438.png", "sizes": "192x192", "type": "image/png" },
    { "src": "https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2897/2897438.png", "sizes": "512x512", "type": "image/png" }
  ]
}
```

#### 4. Crea un archivo llamado `sw.js`
Pega esto:
```js
self.addEventListener('install', (e) => e.waitUntil(caches.open('ferry-v1').then((c) => c.addAll(['/','/index.html']))));
self.addEventListener('fetch', (e) => e.respondWith(caches.match(e.request).then((r) => r || fetch(e.request))));
```

---

### PASO 3: El Gran Final (La Aplicación)

Para simplificarte la vida y no hacerte crear 10 carpetas, voy a comprimir toda la lógica visual en el archivo `App.tsx`.

Haz clic en **`App.tsx`**, borra todo y pega este código maestro.
*(Nota: Este código es largo porque contiene todas las pantallas que diseñamos juntas).*

```tsx
import React, { useState, useEffect, useRef } from 'react';
import { UserRole, RequestStatus, MaterialRequest, Product, Quote, QuoteLineItem } from './types';
import { Button, Card, Badge, StarRating } from './UIComponents';
import { Home, ShoppingBag, Briefcase, User, Camera, Plus, Trash2, Truck, MapPin, CheckCircle2, ArrowLeft, CreditCard, Banknote, Lock, Star, Store, AlertCircle, ShoppingCart, Calculator, Check, X, Menu, Search, Filter, ShieldCheck, Image as ImageIcon, Briefcase as BriefcaseIcon } from 'lucide-react';

// --- COMPONENTES SIMPLIFICADOS ---

const App = () => {
  const [view, setView] = useState<'HOME'|'SHOP'|'HUB'|'PROFILE'|'ADMIN'|'STORE'>('HOME');
  const [role, setRole] = useState<UserRole>(UserRole.USER);
  const [requests, setRequests] = useState<MaterialRequest[]>([]);
  const [activeReqId, setActiveReqId] = useState<string | null>(null);
  const activeReq = requests.find(r => r.id === activeReqId);

  // --- DATOS FALSOS PARA DEMO ---
  const [products] = useState<Product[]>([
    { id: '1', storeId: 's1', name: 'Cemento Argos 50kg', price: 28500, stock: 40, category: 'Obra', description: 'Gris uso general', image: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565793298595-6a879b1d9492?w=200' },
    { id: '2', storeId: 's1', name: 'Tubo PVC 4"', price: 42000, stock: 10, category: 'Plomería', description: 'Sanitario', image: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596489397631-5079a491e7c5?w=200' }
  ]);

  // --- LOGICA DE NEGOCIO ---
  const handleCreateRequest = (req: MaterialRequest) => {
    setRequests([req, ...requests]);
    setActiveReqId(req.id);
    // Simular respuesta de tiendas
    setTimeout(() => {
        setRequests(prev => prev.map(r => {
            if (r.id === req.id) {
                const q1: Quote = { 
                    id: 'q1', storeName: 'Ferretería El Tornillo', totalPrice: 260000, deliveryTime: '45 min', availability: 'Completo', rating: 4.8, includesTransport: true,
                    itemsDetails: req.items.map(i => ({...i, status: 'AVAILABLE', price: 20000})) 
                };
                return { ...r, status: RequestStatus.QUOTED, quotes: [q1] };
            }
            return r;
        }));
    }, 4000);
  };

  // --- VISTAS ---

  // 1. HOME VIEW
  const HomeView = () => (
    <div className="space-y-6 pb-20 p-4">
       <div className="bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-6 text-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
          <h2 className="text-2xl font-bold relative z-10">Hola, Pedro 👋</h2>
          <p className="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4 relative z-10">¿Qué vamos a construir hoy?</p>
          <div className="flex gap-3 relative z-10">
             <button onClick={() => setView('SHOP')} className="flex-1 bg-ferry-600 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                <ShoppingBag size={16}/> Materiales
             </button>
             <button onClick={() => setView('HUB')} className="flex-1 bg-white/10 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                <Briefcase size={16}/> Servicios
             </button>
          </div>
       </div>

       {/* Active Order */}
       {activeReq && activeReq.status !== RequestStatus.DELIVERED && (
          <div onClick={() => setView('SHOP')} className="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-ferry-100 shadow-sm cursor-pointer border-l-4 border-l-ferry-500">
             <div className="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                <h3 className="font-bold text-slate-700">Pedido en Curso</h3>
                <Badge type="warning">{activeReq.status}</Badge>
             </div>
             <p className="text-sm text-slate-500">{activeReq.title}</p>
          </div>
       )}

       {/* Products Grid */}
       <h3 className="font-bold text-slate-800 px-1">Ofertas Flash</h3>
       <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          {products.map(p => (
             <div key={p.id} className="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-100 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                <div className="h-28 bg-slate-100 relative">
                   <img src={p.image} className="w-full h-full object-cover" />
                   <span className="absolute top-2 left-2 bg-red-500 text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded">-10%</span>
                </div>
                <div className="p-3">
                   <h4 className="font-bold text-xs text-slate-700 line-clamp-1">{p.name}</h4>
                   <p className="font-bold text-ferry-600">${p.price.toLocaleString()}</p>
                </div>
             </div>
          ))}
       </div>
    </div>
  );

  // 2. MATERIAL SHOP VIEW
  const ShopView = () => {
     const [mode, setMode] = useState<'INIT'|'SCAN'|'LIST'|'QUOTES'|'PAY'|'TRACK'>('INIT');
     const [items, setItems] = useState<any[]>([]);
     const fileRef = useRef<HTMLInputElement>(null);

     useEffect(() => {
        if(activeReq) {
            if(activeReq.status === RequestStatus.PENDING_QUOTES) setMode('INIT'); // Showing wait screen
            if(activeReq.status === RequestStatus.QUOTED) setMode('QUOTES');
            if(activeReq.status === RequestStatus.PAID) setMode('TRACK');
        }
     }, [activeReq]);

     const handleScan = (e: any) => {
        const file = e.target.files[0];
        if(file) {
            setMode('SCAN');
            setTimeout(() => { // Simulando Gemini
                setItems([{name: 'Tubo PVC', quantity: '3', unit: 'un'}, {name: 'Cemento', quantity: '1', unit: 'bulto'}]);
                setMode('LIST');
            }, 2000);
        }
     };

     if(mode === 'INIT' && !activeReq) return (
        <div className="p-4 space-y-6">
           <h2 className="text-xl font-bold text-center">¿Cómo quieres pedir?</h2>
           <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <Card onClick={() => fileRef.current?.click()} className="h-40 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-2 border-dashed border-ferry-200 bg-ferry-50 cursor-pointer">
                 <Camera className="w-10 h-10 text-ferry-500 mb-2"/>
                 <span className="font-bold text-ferry-700">Foto a Lista</span>
                 <input type="file" ref={fileRef} className="hidden" onChange={handleScan}/>
              </Card>
              <Card onClick={() => {setItems([]); setMode('LIST')}} className="h-40 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 cursor-pointer">
                 <Plus className="w-10 h-10 text-slate-400 mb-2"/>
                 <span className="font-bold text-slate-600">Manual</span>
              </Card>
           </div>
        </div>
     );

     if(mode === 'SCAN') return <div className="h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center"><div className="w-16 h-16 border-4 border-ferry-500 border-t-transparent rounded-full animate-spin mb-4"></div><p>Analizando lista con IA...</p></div>;

     if(mode === 'LIST') return (
        <div className="p-4 flex flex-col h-full pb-20">
           <h2 className="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Tu Lista</h2>
           <div className="flex-1 space-y-3">
              {items.map((it, i) => (
                 <Card key={i} className="flex justify-between items-center">
                    <span>{it.quantity} {it.unit} {it.name}</span>
                    <Trash2 size={16} className="text-red-400" onClick={() => setItems(items.filter((_,idx)=>idx!==i))}/>
                 </Card>
              ))}
              <Button variant="ghost" onClick={() => setItems([...items, {name:'Nuevo Item', quantity:'1', unit:'un'}])}><Plus size={16}/> Agregar</Button>
           </div>
           <Button onClick={() => {
              handleCreateRequest({ 
                  id: Date.now().toString(), title: 'Pedido Nuevo', date: new Date().toISOString(), 
                  items, status: RequestStatus.PENDING_QUOTES, quotes: [] 
              });
              setMode('INIT');
           }}>Cotizar Ahora</Button>
        </div>
     );

     if(mode === 'INIT' && activeReq) return (
         <div className="p-6 text-center pt-20">
            <div className="w-20 h-20 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 animate-pulse"><Store className="text-green-600 w-10 h-10"/></div>
            <h2 className="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Negociando...</h2>
            <p className="text-slate-500">Enviando tu lista a 5 ferreterías cercanas.</p>
            <div className="mt-8 bg-slate-200 h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><div className="bg-ferry-500 h-full w-[80%] animate-[width_2s_ease-in-out]"></div></div>
         </div>
     );

     if(mode === 'QUOTES') return (
         <div className="p-4 pb-20 space-y-4">
             <h2 className="text-xl font-bold">Ofertas Recibidas</h2>
             {activeReq?.quotes.map(q => (
                 <Card key={q.id} className="border-l-4 border-l-ferry-500">
                     <div className="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                         <h3 className="font-bold text-lg">{q.storeName}</h3>
                         <div className="text-right">
                             <p className="font-bold text-2xl text-ferry-600">${q.totalPrice.toLocaleString()}</p>
                             {q.includesTransport && <Badge type="success">Envío Gratis</Badge>}
                         </div>
                     </div>
                     <div className="flex gap-4 text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded">
                         <span className="flex items-center gap-1"><Truck size={14}/> {q.deliveryTime}</span>
                         <span className="flex items-center gap-1"><CheckCircle2 size={14}/> {q.availability}</span>
                     </div>
                     <Button className="w-full" onClick={() => setMode('PAY')}>Comprar</Button>
                 </Card>
             ))}
         </div>
     );

     if(mode === 'PAY') return (
         <div className="p-4 space-y-6">
             <h2 className="text-xl font-bold">Pago Seguro</h2>
             <div className="space-y-3">
                 <div className="p-4 border-2 border-purple-500 bg-purple-50 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div className="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold">N</div>
                    <span className="font-bold text-slate-700">Nequi</span>
                 </div>
                 <div className="p-4 border border-slate-200 bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center gap-3">
                    <CreditCard className="text-slate-400"/>
                    <span className="font-bold text-slate-600">Tarjeta</span>
                 </div>
             </div>
             <Button className="w-full py-4 text-lg mt-8" onClick={() => {
                 setRequests(prev => prev.map(r => r.id === activeReqId ? {...r, status: RequestStatus.PAID} : r));
                 setMode('TRACK');
             }}>Pagar Ahora</Button>
         </div>
     );

     if(mode === 'TRACK') return (
         <div className="h-full bg-slate-100 p-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
             <div className="w-24 h-24 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg mb-6 animate-bounce">
                 <Truck className="w-12 h-12 text-ferry-600"/>
             </div>
             <h2 className="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800">¡Pedido en Camino!</h2>
             <p className="text-slate-500 mb-8">Llega en 15 minutos</p>
             <Button variant="outline" onClick={() => setView('HOME')}>Volver al Inicio</Button>
         </div>
     );
     return null;
  };

  // 3. PROJECT HUB
  const HubView = () => (
      <div className="p-4 pb-20 space-y-4">
          <div className="flex gap-2 mb-4">
             <Button className="flex-1" variant="secondary">Busco Trabajo</Button>
             <Button className="flex-1" variant="ghost">Busco Profesional</Button>
          </div>
          <div className="flex gap-2 overflow-x-auto pb-2">
             {['Todos', 'Plomería', 'Electricidad', 'Obra'].map(c => <Badge key={c} type={c==='Todos'?'info':'neutral'}>{c}</Badge>)}
          </div>
          <Card>
             <div className="flex justify-between"><h3 className="font-bold">Instalación Baño</h3><Badge type="warning">Urgente</Badge></div>
             <p className="text-sm text-slate-500 my-2">Necesito instalar sanitario y lavamanos en Cedritos.</p>
             <div className="flex justify-between items-center mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100">
                <span className="font-bold text-green-600">$120.000</span>
                <Button variant="outline" className="!py-1 !px-3 text-sm">Postularme</Button>
             </div>
          </Card>
      </div>
  );

  return (
    <div className="flex flex-col h-screen bg-gray-50 max-w-md mx-auto shadow-2xl relative">
       {/* HEADER */}
       <header className="bg-white p-4 border-b border-slate-100 flex justify-between items-center z-20">
          <div className="flex items-center gap-2" onClick={() => setView('HOME')}>
             <div className="w-8 h-8 bg-ferry-500 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold italic">F</div>
             <h1 className="font-black text-slate-900 italic tracking-tighter text-xl">FERRY</h1>
          </div>
          <button onClick={() => {
              const roles = [UserRole.USER, UserRole.STORE, UserRole.ADMIN];
              setRole(roles[(roles.indexOf(role) + 1) % roles.length]);
          }} className="text-xs bg-slate-100 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-slate-200">
             {role}
          </button>
       </header>

       {/* MAIN */}
       <main className="flex-1 overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar">
          {view === 'HOME' && <HomeView />}
          {view === 'SHOP' && <ShopView />}
          {view === 'HUB' && <HubView />}
          {view === 'PROFILE' && <div className="p-8 text-center text-slate-400">Perfil de Usuario</div>}
       </main>

       {/* NAVBAR */}
       <nav className="bg-white border-t border-slate-100 p-2 flex justify-between items-center">
          <button onClick={() => setView('HOME')} className={`flex-1 p-2 flex flex-col items-center ${view==='HOME'?'text-ferry-600':'text-slate-400'}`}><Home size={20}/><span className="text-[10px]">Inicio</span></button>
          <button onClick={() => setView('SHOP')} className={`flex-1 p-2 flex flex-col items-center ${view==='SHOP'?'text-ferry-600':'text-slate-400'}`}><ShoppingBag size={20}/><span className="text-[10px]">Tienda</span></button>
          <button onClick={() => setView('HUB')} className={`flex-1 p-2 flex flex-col items-center ${view==='HUB'?'text-ferry-600':'text-slate-400'}`}><Briefcase size={20}/><span className="text-[10px]">Trabajo</span></button>
          <button onClick={() => setView('PROFILE')} className={`flex-1 p-2 flex flex-col items-center ${view==='PROFILE'?'text-ferry-600':'text-slate-400'}`}><User size={20}/><span className="text-[10px]">Perfil</span></button>
       </nav>
    </div>
  );
};
export default App;
```

---

### PASO 4: ¡Ver el Resultado! 🚀

1.  Cuando termines de pegar todo, mira a la derecha de la pantalla. Debería aparecer la aplicación **Ferry** con el logo naranja.
2.  Arriba de la "pantallita" de vista previa, verás una **URL** (ejemplo: `https://react-ferry-xyz.stackblitz.io`).
3.  ¡Envía ese link a tu celular!
4.  Ábrelo en Chrome (Android) o Safari (iOS) y dale **"Agregar a Pantalla de Inicio"**.

¡Listo! Ya tienes tu MVP en el bolsillo. 🏗️

Perdón, tienes toda la razón. Me emocioné y te di demasiada información. Vamos a hacerlo **despacio y con buena letra**.

Ya hiciste el **Paso 1** (`index.html` y `index.tsx`). ¡Excelente! Ya tenemos la "cáscara" de la app.

Ahora vamos con el **Paso 2**. Vamos a crear los archivos que hacen que tu celular reconozca esto como una App real (icono, nombre, instalación).

Sigue estos 2 movimientos exactos:

### Movimiento A: El Archivo de Identidad

1.  En la barra izquierda de archivos, busca el icono de **"New File"** (una hojita con un signo `+`) y dale clic.
2.  Escribe el nombre: `manifest.json` y dale Enter.
3.  Copia y pega este código adentro:

```json
{
  "name": "Ferry - Construcción",
  "short_name": "Ferry",
  "start_url": "/",
  "display": "standalone",
  "background_color": "#ffffff",
  "theme_color": "#f97316",
  "orientation": "portrait",
  "icons": [
    {
      "src": "https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2897/2897438.png",
      "sizes": "192x192",
      "type": "image/png"
    },
    {
      "src": "https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2897/2897438.png",
      "sizes": "512x512",
      "type": "image/png"
    }
  ]
}
```

### Movimiento B: El Archivo de Instalación

1.  Dale clic otra vez al icono de **"New File"** (hojita con `+`).
2.  Escribe el nombre: `sw.js` y dale Enter.
3.  Copia y pega este código corto adentro:

```javascript
self.addEventListener('install', (e) => {
  e.waitUntil(
    caches.open('ferry-store').then((cache) => cache.addAll([
      '/',
      '/index.html',
    ])),
  );
});

self.addEventListener('fetch', (e) => {
  e.respondWith(
    caches.match(e.request).then((response) => response || fetch(e.request)),
  );
});
```

